WEBVTT

00:00:58.638 --> 00:01:03.184
Unlike policies in which one party
profits at the expense of another,

00:01:03.226 --> 00:01:09.148
the four-day week can benefit workers,
companies and society,

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:12.985
and it can even be a gateway
for addressing climate change.

00:01:13.736 --> 00:01:16.197
But first, let's talk about the workplace.

00:01:16.656 --> 00:01:19.075
For nearly a decade,

00:01:19.117 --> 00:01:23.079
companies and governments
have been experimenting with shorter hours

00:01:23.121 --> 00:01:24.622
with no cuts in pay.

00:01:25.289 --> 00:01:26.791
While the results do vary,

00:01:26.791 --> 00:01:30.795
the research shows
that people are less stressed,